sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Cardholder browser
  participant M as Merchant and PSP<br/>(3DS Server)
  participant DS as Card network<br/>Directory Server (DS)
  participant ACS as Issuer Access<br/>Control Server (ACS)
  participant I as Issuer<br/>authorization system
  C->>M: Submit card and order
  M->>C: Collect device and browser data
  C-->>M: Return browser data
  M->>DS: AReq authentication request
  DS->>ACS: Forward AReq
  ACS-->>DS: ARes risk assessment result
  DS-->>M: ARes
  alt Low risk, frictionless
    Note over M: transStatus = Y
  else Further verification needed
    M->>C: Show challenge screen
    C->>ACS: Enter code or confirm in banking app
    ACS-->>M: Final authentication result
  end
  M->>I: Authorization request with authentication result
  I-->>M: Approve or decline
